<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Polymer Group started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Polymer Group started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it started coverage of Polymer Group Inc with a buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- Set price target of $15 per share.</p>
<p>-- Said company is currently trading at 14 percent discount to peer group valuation based on 1998 earnings estimates.</p>
<p>-- Estimates 1997 earnings at $0.90 per share, 1998 at $1.10 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 13.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
